'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an antisocial NPC in the Highlands. They are initially caged in the [[The Highlands#Crystal Cavern|Highlands Cavern]], imprisoned by [[Bully Rex]] and forced to watch as it swallowed their treasures.

The player can free them after slaying Bully Rex and obtaining the [[Golden Key]]. The next day, they will set up their [[The Highlands#Highlands Dwarf's Shop|shop]], left of the path connecting the dock and the Outpost. They sell a variety of mineral-adjacent furniture.

